[h1]Are you tired of missing elections?[/h1]

"Election has started" is locked to a little top bar notification, not a full on event.

The number of times my Ruler with a Destiny has been ousted by some level 3 chump because I missed the notification and so not rigged the damn thing.

So I wrote a mod to help me, it's very simple, an event triggers when the election starts, so you get a front and centre notification that is harder to miss.

That's it.  Not ironman compatible, but no vanilla files changed.

This is tagged as 4.2 compatible, but I expect it to remain working for many, many versions to come until hopefully to decommission it some time Paradox makes elections a standard notification that we can set options on.